## Interface: 120100
## Title: SpeedyBags
## Notes: Bag/bank addon with a real controller nav order and non-blocking updates.
## Author: Luna Niemitalo
## Version: 0.4.0-mvp-pawn
## SavedVariables: SpeedyBagsDB
## OptionalDeps: Leatrix_Plus, Pawn
## X-License: (unset)

# OptionalDeps (not a hard Dependencies) so the addon loader loads
# Leatrix_Plus/Pawn first when present -- Junk.lua reads Leatrix_Plus's
# _G.LeaPlusDB SavedVariables global, Pawn.lua calls
# PawnRegisterThirdPartyBag, both at file-load time; without this, load
# order is arbitrary and either global might not exist yet even when the
# addon is installed, silently falling back to the bare/no-op behavior.
# SpeedyBags loads and works fine without either present at all.

# Interface 120100 confirmed 2026-08-16 against the installed retail client
# (/media/luna/games/World of Warcraft/_retail_/.flavor.info: Version 12.1.0.69299),
# matching references/Baganator/Baganator.toc's value.

Categories.lua
Junk.lua
Pawn.lua
Data.lua
UI.lua
SpeedyBags.lua
